-- Pushed predicates over each comparable type family.
EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
SELECT array_agg(id ORDER BY id) AS ids
FROM lagodb_connectors_regress.offload_types
WHERE date_col >= DATE '2024-01-01'
  AND timestamptz_col < TIMESTAMPTZ '2030-01-01 00:00:00+00';
                                                                    QUERY PLAN                                                                    
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (LagoDB Query Offload)
   Engine: DataFusion
   ->  Aggregate
         Aggregates: ARRAY_AGG(id ORDER BY id ASC NULLS LAST)
         ->  Table Scan on offload_types
               Foreign Data Wrapper: lagodb_connectors
               Filter: (date_col >= '01-01-2024'::date) AND (timestamptz_col < 'Mon Dec 31 16:00:00 2029 PST'::timestamp with time zone)
               Pushed Filter: ((date_col >= '01-01-2024'::date) AND (timestamptz_col < 'Mon Dec 31 16:00:00 2029 PST'::timestamp with time zone))
